  <h2 id="food-care-heading">Storage & serving</h2>
  <p>Keep boards and sandwiches refrigerated until serving. Consume within two hours of removing from refrigeration, including travel time. Add separately packed crackers and bread just before serving.</p>
  <p>Review our <a href="/food-purchase-consumption-waiver">food purchase and consumption waiver</a> for allergy and handling information.</p>
